# weather emotes store snapshot
# weather tables: 9   seasonal-ambience tables: 6
# Recorded 2026-09-16 from PRE-migration code: a baseline of existing behaviour,
# not a record of what a later migration produced.
# dimensions: type x section(outdoor/sheltered) x biome x band x season, then
# (track,season) ambience. Band applies to sheltered rows only; outdoor lines
# are never felt-banded.
# "sheltered" names the ROOM, not the section: item 9 PR 2 splits it into
# indoor and underground, and these row keys must survive that split.
# Biome is authored keys UNION a representative set (cave, dungeon, house,
# fort, spiderweb, forest) on both axes: the only authored sheltered key is
# "default", so without this set the golden would never see a cave and PR 2's
# split would land with no diff; the same union on outdoor exercises its own
# biome-to-default fallback.
# Single role (the room is told), no tokens authored anywhere in this store.
# A fresh SequencePicker per row pins index 0.
# An empty row ("") in a mild band is deliberate silence, not a missing pool.

